# Users module boundary

- Code under `modules/users/**` must never import directly from
  `modules/profiles/src/**`. Cross-module data must go through
  `modules/shared/src/**` or an HTTP call to the profiles module's own
  routes - never a direct source import.
- Do not add a dependency on Express route internals from another
  module; only import `Router` from `express` itself.
- New exported functions in `modules/users/src/controllers/**` must
  have a corresponding test in `modules/users/tests/**` before a diff
  touching them is considered done.
- Follow the existing pattern in this module: routes wire paths only,
  controllers hold logic, validators are separate middleware, `sendError`
  from `@shared/utils/http` is the only way to return an error body.
